| i (word) | s = i | Step = s+2 | Valid j values | Chars taken |
|----------|-------|------------|----------------|-------------|
| 1 (jump) | 1 | 3 | j=1 only | "u" |
| 2 (swim) | 2 | 4 | j=1 only | "w" |
| 3 (read) | 3 | 5 | j=1 only | "e" |
| 4 (write)| 4 | 6 | j=1 only | "r" |
